        <briefdescription>
<para>Modbus function codes. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The I2C implementation uses the Modbus protocol and encapsulates the message in I2C format; however, in this case CRC is not included. Function codes vary according to the data type and whether a single or multiple read/write is performed.</para>
<para>Modbus data model:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Discrete Inputs: 1bit. Read only.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Coils: 1bit. Read/Write.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Input Registers: 16bits. Read only.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Holding Registers: 16bits. Read/Write. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
