    <briefdescription>
<para>This is a library for the Telaire <ref refid="classT67XX" kindref="compound">T67XX</ref> series miniature CO2 sensor module. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These sensors use UART and I2C to communicate. This library is designed for the I2C communication option. 2 pins are required for the interface. To enable I2C communication, connect pin CTRL (pin 6 of the module) to GND.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>[ALD-DSL/ATARI_RESEARCH_LAB] </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>[2024-07-22/2025-10-15] </para>
